es that for exactly this fixture the held-out key 'buckets stale, so `--check` exits 0 and `--update-stale` is not run'.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f4e4dd0477eb37642","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"AC5 (5th acceptance criterion, 'AMENDED 2026-10-31 (2nd)') and Scope ('`.github/mechanism-baseline.json` is in scope for the AC5 drain only')","norm_id":"ndbf5424f123ec174","priority":0.0943,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Leaf executes --update-stale and commits a baseline edit the parent epic explicitly says is not performed, so the as-built change diverges from the parent's recorded plan decision.","If the parent's ratchet note is in fact correct (make verify tolerates the stale row), the leaf has added an out-of-scope baseline edit the parent assigned to no one."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Raise the make-verify-vs-ratchet-note tension on the parent epic 6ed2 and amend its ratchet note to permit (or require) the `--update-stale` drain + committed baseline shrink; once the parent is corrected and re-reviewed, keep AC5 as-is. Until then, align AC5 to the parent (no `--update-stale`, no baseline edit).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.3571,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"insufficient","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"insufficient"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"low","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_i